{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are like me, feeling stressful with study buddy, but enjoying working on the transport. This is something for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a Pomodoro Technique at the bottom of your screen. Listen to the whistle sound, rail white noise, lofi music. Drill into this comfortable environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today is the day, let's start your study journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/b59dbb6db3557f78c2095130805e42da.poster.avif?t=1748481631\" width=616 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/b59dbb6db3557f78c2095130805e42da.webm?t=1748481631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/b59dbb6db3557f78c2095130805e42da.mp4?t=1748481631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Description / Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Study tools using Pomodoro Technique to help you study</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can treat the game as a Pomodoro Technique, and study / work / play during those duration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A story behind as a reward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players joined a charity learning marathon, enable someone to travel through Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Decorate your own train room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can have decoration in their train, also they can adjust different music, weather, time and season, to have a comfortable travel journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minimize mode which can be dragged to anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/de86320832a8bb4dda2c43aba6101355.poster.avif?t=1748481631\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/de86320832a8bb4dda2c43aba6101355.webm?t=1748481631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/de86320832a8bb4dda2c43aba6101355.mp4?t=1748481631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>FURTHERMORE<br><br>This game is completed, but we want to further improve it if we have resources:<br>- A chart to show the learning time span in the past week. (&gt;1000 copies)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/665bb3b35138e1191bbd6cf9feb288ab.avif?t=1748481631\" width=369 height=225 /></span><br>- Watch the train from outside (&gt;5000 copies)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/bd58a53504581aaa28d2ae4f08f301fa.avif?t=1748481631\" width=614 height=344 /></span><br>Once again, these two features are something we want to see in future, not contain in the current product.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595900?t=1748481631","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595900?t=1748481631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/f1da6510ba2395ac0333ecbad3a937849407c435/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748481631","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_